{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-13_beg",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-13",
  "title": "逃離炮火",
  "storyCode": "10-15",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-13_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6e4c2b3dbacf07417b82c7a581c6b6610aff5421d1fd3b1690a654924c42da4d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "11-beg"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g6_hideout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情況怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——D區和E區受到嚴重損傷，其他區域頂層結構也有不同程度破損！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "輕傷十九人，暫時沒人重傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好，指揮官，我們聽了您和那位博士的話，把大部分人提前轉移到了安全區域——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，並不安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整個地塊都很危險......我們的據點完全暴露在了薩卡茲面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在把這裡徹底炸穿，確保我們無處可躲之前，他們是不會罷手的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們還有多少時間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三十分鐘，呃，說不定時間更短一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "附近的地塊年紀都挺大了，以我們之前見過的城防炮的威力，再乘以一個輸出極值理論倍數——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不出三十分鐘，我們頭頂的全部結構層就會被轟爛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通知哈默，我們立刻啟動列車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "列車？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們應該都見過了，在我們頭頂幾公里處，有一個車站。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為車站已經被薩卡茲佔了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們必須把它奪回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今薩卡茲截斷了我們通往其他區塊的所有管道，這是我們撤離薩迪恩區的最後希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海蒂，一旦我們離開薩迪恩區，你有方法幫我們避開薩卡茲的視線吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我一直準備著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到下一個站點，會有朋友來幫我們做好偽裝和掩護，直到我們成功進入中央區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最大的問題還是，我們能不能安全登上列車——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克洛維希婭，我們目前離城牆多遠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走地下通道的話，很近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想試試從下面登上城牆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，你是想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會為自救軍的撤退爭取時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g4_giantwall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "封鎖目標地塊的全部出口，盯緊車站。我不希望他們再逃進下一個陰溝裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "設置地面活動目標動態追蹤。萬一他們不死心，想爬到地面上，使用其他載具，那他們就必須直面更猛烈的炮火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加強城牆內部所有節點的防禦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還有，修改城防炮的控制口令，確保除我以外，沒人能關閉它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好，足夠謹慎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將軍？！您為何會來這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再過一會，這些惱人的蟲豸就再無藏身之地。整個倫蒂尼姆的反抗勢力不會再敢輕舉妄動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更關鍵的是，不會再有人從我們看不見的暗道裡進進出出。外面的公爵部隊將只能看到我們篩選過後的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有人能再影響我們的工程進度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曼弗雷德，這樣值得慶祝的時刻，你不歡迎我與你一同迎接嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請不要再同我開玩笑了，閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？你又進步了嘛，這次我們只說了五句話，你就發現了我們不是特雷西斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閣下......雖然殿下不會同你計較，但如果你這副樣子被赦罪師的人看見，他們一定會再次向殿下申請，限制你的行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧好吧，你說的對，軍事委員會不能有兩個發號施令的人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就讓我們換一個更舒服的模樣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......難得，你願意用王庭會議時的形象來見我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們答應你了，不用逝者的臉，也不再嚇唬你和你的戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你回來得比預定的時間更早。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然你幫我們找到了反抗軍的窩點，但他們依然可能有其他我沒注意到的後路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如你能跟說好的一樣，一路跟著他們，直到最後一名反抗軍落到我們手中......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真以為那個博士能讓我們藏那麼久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更何況，曼弗雷德，你別忘了，我們不歸你管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我冒昧了，請閣下寬恕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也別用這種跟老紅眼病說話的語氣跟我們說話，早說過了，我們不吃這套。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如你所願，閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你選擇提前回到這裡，那麼，你在地下看到你想看見的了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......那個“魔王”比我們想像的要更堅強一些，不過還遠遠算不上成熟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她呀，她還不知道自己即將面對什麼，我們想瞭解更多的話，至少要等她見一見那位殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你這些話，最好別讓赦罪師聽見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽見又怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們會以為變形者集群的王庭有......搖擺之心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得我們會在乎嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曼弗雷德，我們答應你的事已經做完了，剩下的爛攤子，你和血魔自己收拾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_426_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了......再有下次的話，給我們挑一個還活著的身份吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g6_hideout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，阿米婭和博士已經出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一批自救軍戰士正在趕往頭頂的車站......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，快走，都跟上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等戰士們成功奪下車站，傷患們和沒有戰鬥力的平民會最先登上列車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白輪先生，麻煩你和醫療幹員們一起照顧下行動不便的傷患，大家留意通道兩側的信號燈，不要走散！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大部分指揮部的人會隨著傷患和平民一起轉移，除了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的人都進入撤退通道了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "頂部結構穩定性持續下降！指揮官，你趕緊離開這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要所有人都進了通道，我自然會跟上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十二隊，彙報情況！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指揮官，這地下都快待不了人了，真的還會有敵人下來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "彙報！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，我們要跟上白輪他們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們留下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留下？你是說陪著克洛維希婭指揮官一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一種感覺......這種感覺可能她也有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最強大的敵人，或許此刻並不在我們頭頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......城防炮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，號角，城防炮又啟動了！這一次他們對準的是距離城牆最近的地塊，目前來看，轟炸中心不在這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但誰都不能保證附近的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跑啊，快跑——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的女兒去了哪裡......誰看見我的女兒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請立刻進入最堅固的建築物避險——不，用最快的速度遠離城牆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好......好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......倫蒂尼姆的城防炮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "照目前的情況來看，要不了多久，炮火就能貫穿地塊，甚至破壞最下方的基底結構。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死的薩卡茲，他們是不是早就等著這一刻了？他們是準備徹底毀了這座城市嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。他們只啟動了少量炮口，打擊目標也很明確。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們是為了消滅我們......和我們的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅本",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "號角，我們該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天跟我們回來的士兵之中，是不是有幾位原本就駐守在此的城防軍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫上他們。拿上最好的裝備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟他們說——是時候把我們的城牆從薩卡茲手裡奪回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g7_subway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再往前一點點就到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心，別在這裡摔倒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還好吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......很難說得上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我能懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也犯過大錯，信任了不該信任的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那之後，一個多月的時間，我只能逼著自己不要停下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要一停下來，我就......呃，覺得自己很難直視阿米婭的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，仗還沒打完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家連喘息的時間都不夠，要是我還想著哀悼或者自我懷疑的話，也太奢侈了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費斯特先生，你需要幫助嗎？我可以幫助你平復情緒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平復情緒？這也是某種源石技藝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你平時......也會為你的戰士做這些心理治療嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果幹員自己覺得有必要的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別誤會，阿米婭是關心大家。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "阿米婭並不想把幹員變成無情的戰鬥機器。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費斯特先生，我讓你誤會了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，倒也沒有，就是覺得源石技藝真的很神奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算生在倫蒂尼姆這樣的城市，我沒見過的，還是很多啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭小姐，謝謝你的好意。不過，我還不想那麼快就把剛才那一幕從我的腦子裡驅趕出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那接著幹活囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹活吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無人機顯示，我們頭頂的防禦結構層......非常厚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能爆破嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能性很低。如果倫蒂尼姆的城防系統能這麼輕易就被炸開......呃，我們昨天就該殺進碎片大廈了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你能找到辦法。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我相信可露希爾。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，謝謝你對我的信心，這可真是壓榨員工的好辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我掃描到了升降梯，只要你們能找到一個合適的縫隙，讓我把無人機塞進去，我就能黑到升降梯的控制權......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，首先你們得找一個更大的縫隙，來把自己弄到上面去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你不覺得你應該發個信號，讓Misery趕過來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他有其他任務。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，看來我們沒法偷懶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本地人先生，麻煩再給我一些靈感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是能找到支柱結構，再施加一個超強外力的話，應該能開一條縫出來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有人正在迅速接近我們的位置！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲料到了我們會想辦法登牆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管不了那麼多了，我讓無人機搭載源石炸藥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費斯特，你算好位置，我們再想個辦法放大爆炸效果——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又見面了，羅德島的領導人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W小姐她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確定要先聊她的事嗎？我聽說你們的時間很緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以不問你們之間發生了什麼。切爾諾伯格和Scout的事......我也同意暫且放到一邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，雇傭兵先生，如果此刻你一定要擋在我們身前，我動手的時候絕不會猶豫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死在那位殿下的繼承人手上，對一名雇傭兵來說，也算是一種榮耀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，你最好快一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在剛才，我的炸彈已經開始倒數計時了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一分鐘，我們最多只有一分鐘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來拖住赫德雷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。阿米婭小姐，這個雇傭兵交給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費斯特先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我找到了支柱的位置。而且，我有個主意，雖然不知道有多牢靠......能成功的話，你和博士抓緊時間登牆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認得你，年輕的戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也認得你臉上的表情。你終於知道自己失去了多少，而且正在為自己決策的正當性感到迷茫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷茫嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，就算有時間，我也不想跟劊子手談心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看這裡——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......又是煙霧彈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算少了一條能動的胳膊，你這些道具也對我起不了作用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來啊，薩卡茲，朝我砍過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用上你的劍，你的刀，你所有的武器——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想引開我？不算太明智的策略。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "缺乏自知之明的孤勇並不能創造奇跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算你所有的手下都在這裡，你們也無法戰勝我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你逃跑的模樣越來越狼狽。沒有其他人幫你的話，你很快就會流血而死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說到底，你只是一個工匠......你和你的手下，不過是揮舞著扳手和錘子，就想扛住薩卡茲在戰爭中淬煉百年的刀劍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向那邊的魔王求救吧。讓她來處置我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......魔王？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說......什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲......是你們把戰火燒到了倫蒂尼姆......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，這就是我們之間的戰爭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三十秒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭，集中能量。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，抓住我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費斯特先生，我需要你鎖定位置——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雇傭兵......你看到這個了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......又是什麼奇怪的障眼法道具？別掙扎了，你騙不過我的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，就是這樣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻煩更用力一些！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是......磐蟹？一個機械玩具？你又想靠小伎倆蒙混過去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，它是你們從我身邊帶走的最重要的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從來不是孤身戰鬥......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，老比爾又幫了我一次。雇傭兵，也多虧了你的多疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的多疑？你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你利用了我的攻擊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......哈哈！你終於看明白了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你砍向我的每一刀，都是通往你們失敗的道路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，結構層被赫德雷劈開了一條縫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，瞄準它，炸彈就快炸了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三，二，一——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撕開了——這條縫隙足夠大！無人機——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "升降梯控制權到手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我們上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費斯特，你還有力氣嗎？拉住滑索，我們跟上去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別想走——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾，還有炸藥嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有，你接住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝你的幫助，雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
